Require exact python version to match robotpkg selected version.

--- rclpy/CMakeLists.txt~	2026-05-22 11:49:05.000000000 +0200
+++ rclpy/CMakeLists.txt	2026-06-09 23:53:21.356908783 +0200
@@ -42,11 +42,9 @@
